#. Translators: Title that is shown if we couldn't load the video track for
#. the opened file (but possibly loaded audio).
#: src/video_preview.blp:17
msgid "Could Not Load Video Track"
msgstr "Видео жолын жүктеу мүмкін емес"

#. Translators: Description that is shown if we couldn't load the video track
#. for the opened file (but possibly loaded audio).
#: src/video_preview.blp:20
msgid "Maybe the file only has an audio track, or maybe the necessary video codec is missing."
msgstr "Файлда тек аудио жолы болуы мүмкін немесе қажетті видео кодегі жоқ."

